WEBVTT

00:00:09.370 --> 00:00:12.360
Ayukawa! Ayukawa!

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:16.560
Though, if I never got better... things might be...

00:00:16.870 --> 00:00:19.020
That's not true!

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:20.960
Madoka...

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:23.480
I'm sorry... that you got hurt like this,
for my sake...

00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:30.050
Step outside!

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:48.960
As I tried to kiss you, as if to avoid me...

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:56.770
...with your T-Shirt on,
you dove into the shining sea...

00:00:56.770 --> 00:01:03.140
The white flower petals on your soaking skirt...

00:01:03.140 --> 00:01:09.710
Spread open upon the surface of the blue water.

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:18.730
Tell me why, when you winked...

00:01:18.730 --> 00:01:26.670
...to tell me that you'd be mine...

00:01:26.670 --> 00:01:31.340
Oh Baby, Tell Me, Tell Me -
You're unpredictable...

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:34.640
'Tell me you love me, Tell me that you need me...

00:01:34.640 --> 00:01:38.550
Tell Me, Tell Me,...my Angel of the Summer...

00:01:38.550 --> 00:01:41.150
'Tell me, lover, Tell me that you need me...

00:01:41.150 --> 00:01:45.690
Oh Baby, Tell Me, Tell Me -
I know that you're in love...

00:01:45.690 --> 00:01:49.090
'Tell me you love me,
Tell me that you need me...

00:01:49.090 --> 00:01:55.600
Tell Me, Tell Me - but you're a mystery.

00:02:06.760 --> 00:02:12.670
Marked Woman Madoka!
Kyosuke, Proving He's a Man.

00:02:33.020 --> 00:02:36.600
What?! A...Ayukawa got hurt?!

00:02:36.600 --> 00:02:40.510
Yup. No doubt about it.
We saw her, y'know.

00:02:40.510 --> 00:02:44.920
She left the hospital on her own, so I doubt it's that serious, but...

00:02:44.920 --> 00:02:47.620
But she sure looked like she was in real pain, didn't she!

00:02:47.620 --> 00:02:50.460
What?! I'll go see her for a little bit!

00:02:50.460 --> 00:02:55.500
Oh, by the way... Take Kurumi and Manami,
so they can help her out.

00:02:55.500 --> 00:02:59.830
Right on! Right on! We can be
very useful if we're around, y'know!

00:02:59.830 --> 00:03:01.300
See?

00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:03.940
Perhaps that's not such a good idea, after all.

00:03:04.820 --> 00:03:09.070
Besides, if I take care of her,
and help her out with this and that...

00:03:09.070 --> 00:03:11.610
...maybe there'll be a chance for us to be alone!

00:03:11.610 --> 00:03:12.910
And then I...

00:03:12.910 --> 00:03:16.450
...wanna get real friendly, apparently! With Madoka-oneechan, that is!

00:03:16.450 --> 00:03:16.670
So THAT'S it!

00:03:16.670 --> 00:03:18.830
So THAT'S it!
So THAT'S it!

00:03:18.830 --> 00:03:18.920
So THAT'S it!

00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:24.510
Er... well... this, y'see... is, er... simply a...

00:03:24.510 --> 00:03:27.150
...well, as friends, when friends need each other...

00:03:27.150 --> 00:03:30.630
...er, well... oh, how should I put it...
we must support each other!

00:03:30.630 --> 00:03:34.630
It's the beauty of "friendship" at work... something that's so touching...

00:03:34.630 --> 00:03:36.980
...or so I believe, you see...

00:03:38.220 --> 00:03:39.930
I'll show her how considerate Kasuga Kyosuke is.

00:03:39.930 --> 00:03:42.970
A gentleman who's willing to go the extra mile just for her...

00:03:42.970 --> 00:03:45.090
Yes, I'll show her good!

00:03:45.090 --> 00:03:46.890
Yes?
Yes, I'll show her good!

00:03:47.400 --> 00:03:50.420
Sempai! What's going on?

00:03:50.420 --> 00:03:52.320
H... Hikaru!

00:03:52.320 --> 00:03:57.310
If it's about Madoka, no need to worry!
I'm with her, y'know!

00:03:58.140 --> 00:04:00.110
It's just some bruises.
They said they'll heal in a couple of weeks.

00:04:00.110 --> 00:04:02.380
They'll heal before you know it!

00:04:02.380 --> 00:04:03.400
Looks like it

00:04:03.400 --> 00:04:05.880
But, still... how did it happen?

00:04:05.880 --> 00:04:06.850
Huh?!
But, still... how did it happen?

00:04:07.820 --> 00:04:09.450
Was it an accident or something?

00:04:09.450 --> 00:04:11.850
Oh... uh-huh. This and that...
Was it an accident or something?

00:04:12.120 --> 00:04:14.760
Madoka fell, you know.

00:04:14.760 --> 00:04:17.030
Yeah! In a stairwell...
Madoka fell, you know.

00:04:17.030 --> 00:04:19.220
Talk about a klutz, huh?
Yeah! In a stairwell...

00:04:19.800 --> 00:04:21.930
A... A stairwell?!

00:04:21.930 --> 00:04:23.900
Yeah...
A... A stairwell?!

00:04:24.600 --> 00:04:28.130
Well, at any rate...
I'm glad it was nothing serious.

00:04:28.840 --> 00:04:30.910
There, all done!

00:04:30.910 --> 00:04:32.780
Thanks, Hikaru.
There, all done!

00:04:32.780 --> 00:04:33.540
You're very welcome!
Thanks, Hikaru.

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:35.020
You're very welcome!

00:04:35.020 --> 00:04:36.210
Oh, Sempai?

00:04:36.210 --> 00:04:37.080
Huh?
Oh, Sempai?

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:37.650
Is coffee okay?
Huh?

00:04:37.650 --> 00:04:39.350
Is coffee okay?

00:04:39.350 --> 00:04:41.320
Uh... Uh-huh.

00:04:42.320 --> 00:04:44.970
Did I... go overboard
getting you this, I wonder?

00:04:44.970 --> 00:04:46.320
Huh?

00:04:46.320 --> 00:04:48.120
Oh, thank you, Darling!

00:04:55.330 --> 00:04:59.860
I couldn't do a thing while Hikaru was there.

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:02.330
Hold it, you!

00:05:05.580 --> 00:05:08.090
Yo, listen up, my man!

00:05:08.090 --> 00:05:10.430
Wanna ask ya somethin'.

00:05:10.430 --> 00:05:12.570
Y...Yes?

00:05:12.570 --> 00:05:15.680
We hear there's a bitch 'round here
who thinks she's fresh!

00:05:16.990 --> 00:05:19.060
The one who got hurt recently.

00:05:19.060 --> 00:05:20.110
"Hurt?!"
The one who got hurt recently.

00:05:20.490 --> 00:05:23.820
What's the bitch's name? Yo!

00:05:24.460 --> 00:05:26.290
I... I don't know!

00:05:28.600 --> 00:05:32.150
Tell the truth. It's for
your own good, li'l boy!

00:05:32.150 --> 00:05:34.870
M... Miss, I really don't know!

00:05:34.870 --> 00:05:36.280
For real?
M... Miss, I really don't know!

00:05:36.280 --> 00:05:36.840
It... It's the truth, Miss!
For real?

00:05:36.840 --> 00:05:38.830
It... It's the truth, Miss!

00:05:38.830 --> 00:05:40.720
If ya ever see her...

00:05:40.720 --> 00:05:44.710
...tell that bitch that Yoko
from Minato-ku wants to pay her back.

00:06:55.420 --> 00:06:58.350
"Ayukawa! Ayukawa!"

00:07:06.930 --> 00:07:09.900
Ayukawa!

00:07:11.570 --> 00:07:14.540
Ayukawa!...Huh?

00:07:20.280 --> 00:07:23.820
If everyone at school finds out...

00:07:23.820 --> 00:07:25.850
...that Ayukawa's still involved with that kind of people...

00:07:33.290 --> 00:07:37.120
I've got to protect her with all my might... or else!

00:07:46.740 --> 00:07:51.040
Well, we can begin by escorting her to and from school!

00:08:09.060 --> 00:08:11.870
Umao!

00:08:11.870 --> 00:08:15.180
Wherefore art thou, Umao?!

00:08:15.180 --> 00:08:18.790
Ushiko! And, wherefore art thou, Ushiko?!

00:08:18.790 --> 00:08:20.370
Umao!

00:08:20.370 --> 00:08:22.340
Ushiko!
Umao!

00:08:27.080 --> 00:08:28.940
Good morning, Sempai!

00:08:29.480 --> 00:08:32.380
Oh! Hikaru! Good morning.

00:08:32.820 --> 00:08:35.110
My, why are you dressed up like that?

00:08:35.620 --> 00:08:37.140
Huh?! Oh, it's nothing...

00:08:37.140 --> 00:08:42.710
Just thought that I'd practice baseball at the batting center or something.

00:08:42.710 --> 00:08:46.250
You never fail to amaze me;
you're so athletic!

00:08:46.250 --> 00:08:47.430
Well, y'know.

00:08:47.430 --> 00:08:50.370
Okay then, I'll see you later!
Well, y'know.

00:08:50.370 --> 00:08:51.090
Okay!
Okay then, I'll see you later!

00:08:51.500 --> 00:08:54.470
They're gonna close if you don't hurry up!

00:08:55.840 --> 00:09:00.000
A... Ayukawa?! Wait for me!

00:09:00.710 --> 00:09:02.970
Please, go ahead and enjoy!

00:09:03.510 --> 00:09:08.040
I'll prepare meals for you until
you're completely healed, Madoka!

00:09:08.040 --> 00:09:10.570
Thank you, Hikaru.

00:09:10.570 --> 00:09:14.450
Sempai, you'll take notes
for Madoka too, won't you?

00:09:15.320 --> 00:09:17.380
I know that!

00:09:23.130 --> 00:09:24.780
Here you go.

00:09:24.780 --> 00:09:28.920
Well, things feel pretty safe, at least during school hours.

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:30.870
I got a lot more respect now!

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:35.790
"With me behind the camera, you are the star!"

00:09:35.790 --> 00:09:38.800
I'm talking about Hikaru!

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:41.750
I never realized what a
considerate girl she was!

00:09:42.990 --> 00:09:44.670
Where did you get the camera?!

00:09:44.670 --> 00:09:47.530
Well, y'know, portrait collection can only take you so far.

00:09:47.530 --> 00:09:50.350
"Madonna in Motion -
The Smile of Excitement Series."

00:09:50.860 --> 00:09:55.090
Oh, stand still, Time! You are too beautiful!

00:09:56.430 --> 00:10:02.390
If there's ever a need...
I don't see how I can depend on those two!

00:10:03.240 --> 00:10:05.420
What?! You're working at ABCB?!

00:10:05.420 --> 00:10:10.530
Yeah. I promised that I'd work there while Master's traveling abroad.

00:10:10.530 --> 00:10:13.150
But, in your condition!

00:10:13.150 --> 00:10:15.290
It'll be fine.
But, in your condition!

00:10:15.290 --> 00:10:16.790
No, it won't!
It'll be fine.

00:10:16.790 --> 00:10:16.920
No, it won't!

00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:17.720
What?
No, it won't!

00:10:18.350 --> 00:10:19.600
Er... I mean...

00:10:19.600 --> 00:10:22.920
You'd be better off staying home
and not going out.

00:10:23.730 --> 00:10:26.700
But, I promised him, so...

00:10:30.600 --> 00:10:32.970
Well? Is it ME or what?

00:10:37.440 --> 00:10:40.260
Uh-huh! You look very good in it!

00:10:40.260 --> 00:10:42.470
You don't have to do this, you know, Hikaru.

00:10:42.910 --> 00:10:46.060
I don't mind at all!
Leave it to me, yessiree!

00:10:46.060 --> 00:10:47.170
Okay?

00:10:47.170 --> 00:10:49.120
Lookin' good! Okay! Okay! This way!

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:49.810
Whoa! Whoa!
Lookin' good! Okay! Okay! This way!

00:10:49.810 --> 00:10:49.900
Lookin' good! Okay! Okay! This way!

00:10:49.900 --> 00:10:52.770
All right! The title's been decided upon!

00:10:52.770 --> 00:10:55.030
"Tale of a heroic, hard-working, happy-happy-joyful girl...

00:10:55.030 --> 00:10:59.350
...laboring alone, desperate to save her wounded, whimsical sempai!"

00:10:59.350 --> 00:11:02.400
Uh-huh! The perfect title for
a cinema presentation on TV!

00:11:02.870 --> 00:11:05.330
Oh, gosh! Yippee!

00:11:06.140 --> 00:11:08.220
Hey! Enough already!

00:11:08.220 --> 00:11:09.860
Say what? Huh?

00:11:09.860 --> 00:11:12.820
He who follows our damsel around like a pest: Chimpanzee Yuusaku!

00:11:12.820 --> 00:11:16.090
Oh, how dramatic you are! Uh-huh!

00:11:16.090 --> 00:11:17.910
You bozos!

00:11:19.080 --> 00:11:22.330
We're joking! Joking!

00:11:22.330 --> 00:11:23.150
We were only joking!

00:11:23.150 --> 00:11:23.680
Just joking!
We were only joking!

00:11:23.680 --> 00:11:23.770
We were only joking!

00:11:23.770 --> 00:11:25.540
Oh! That angry expression!
Nice! There! There!

00:11:25.540 --> 00:11:26.790
Nice!

00:11:26.790 --> 00:11:27.850
All right! I got it!
Nice!

00:11:27.850 --> 00:11:27.940
Nice!

00:11:27.940 --> 00:11:28.590
Yippee!

00:11:28.590 --> 00:11:29.720
Oh! Hold it!
Yippee!

00:11:29.720 --> 00:11:29.810
Yippee!

00:11:29.810 --> 00:11:30.950
Ah! Oh! That's nice too!

00:11:30.950 --> 00:11:31.090
Huh? Like this?!

00:11:31.090 --> 00:11:32.290
Oh! Adorable!
Huh? Like this?!

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:32.380
Huh? Like this?!

00:11:32.380 --> 00:11:33.720
You're adorable!

00:11:34.130 --> 00:11:34.600
Next pose! Next!

00:11:34.600 --> 00:11:35.700
I feel like a star!
Next pose! Next!

00:11:35.700 --> 00:11:36.730
Yeah! You're daring!
I feel like a star!

00:11:36.730 --> 00:11:36.820
Yeah! You're daring!

00:11:36.820 --> 00:11:40.100
Yes! Good! Yeah, just like that!

00:11:40.370 --> 00:11:42.740
Very nice! A masterpiece in the making, maybe!

00:11:43.910 --> 00:11:46.470
Yuusaku, I think you should go along.

00:11:50.510 --> 00:11:53.070
It's all right. I just need to go to the hospital for a check-up.

00:11:53.620 --> 00:11:54.880
Exactly, right?

00:11:54.880 --> 00:11:55.650
No... Besides, you're stronger...
Exactly, right?

00:11:55.650 --> 00:11:56.850
No... Besides, you're stronger...

00:11:59.020 --> 00:12:01.700
Huh? Oh! You know... this and that...

00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:04.000
All sorts of things need to get taken care of, so...

00:12:04.000 --> 00:12:04.460
Right, Yuusaku?

00:12:04.460 --> 00:12:05.950
Whoa...
Right, Yuusaku?

00:12:05.950 --> 00:12:06.040
Right, Yuusaku?

00:12:06.040 --> 00:12:07.860
H... Hey!

00:12:08.530 --> 00:12:11.760
See to it that she gets home safely, understand?

00:12:14.270 --> 00:12:16.670
Okay, Hikaru! Work! Work!

00:12:17.170 --> 00:12:21.060
Oh, Madoka... you can leave ABCB in my hands!

00:12:21.060 --> 00:12:23.090
Us men will be happy to lend a hand...

00:12:23.090 --> 00:12:24.130
...so don't you worry about a thing, okay?

00:12:24.130 --> 00:12:24.710
Go! Go!

00:12:24.710 --> 00:12:26.680
Go! Go! Okay? Let's get going!
Go! Go!

00:12:31.690 --> 00:12:33.390
Take care!

00:12:33.390 --> 00:12:35.380
C'mon now, Hikaru! Work! Work!
Take care!

00:12:35.380 --> 00:12:35.470
Take care!

00:12:35.470 --> 00:12:36.460
Sure!

00:12:36.460 --> 00:12:37.750
Wanna take a wide turn there?
Sure!

00:12:37.750 --> 00:12:37.800
Sure!

00:12:37.800 --> 00:12:39.120
Oh! How daring!

00:12:41.500 --> 00:12:46.160
The others knew...
nothing about those delinquents...

00:12:53.550 --> 00:12:55.970
Cool! Cool!

00:12:55.970 --> 00:12:58.020
All right! Lookin' good!

00:13:06.800 --> 00:13:10.620
When I showed it off,
the guys just LOVED it!

00:13:10.620 --> 00:13:14.150
They're digging how admirable Hikaru is,
never mind that it's just a film!

00:13:14.150 --> 00:13:19.160
They're saying that you guys look "just like newlyweds!"

00:13:21.880 --> 00:13:22.280
You stud!

00:13:22.280 --> 00:13:22.880
You stud!
You stud!

00:13:22.880 --> 00:13:24.940
Dude! You stud!
You stud!

00:13:24.940 --> 00:13:25.010
Dude! You stud!

00:13:25.010 --> 00:13:28.030
"Where will you Honeymoon?"

00:13:28.030 --> 00:13:29.310
"Heartwarming family" "Go for it, Dad!"

00:13:35.560 --> 00:13:38.530
Gimme a break!

00:13:42.530 --> 00:13:46.020
Y...Y'mean, Sempai and me?!

00:13:46.700 --> 00:13:49.220
I wanted it to be a secret though!

00:13:49.220 --> 00:13:51.270
Hikaru!

00:13:53.110 --> 00:13:56.100
Okay, Sempai! I'll see you later!

00:14:03.290 --> 00:14:06.360
S...Seems everybody's got it all wrong!

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:10.450
Gosh, they sure put me in an awkward position!

00:14:12.960 --> 00:14:14.200
How passionate.

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:14.960
What?!
How passionate.

00:14:14.960 --> 00:14:16.160
What?!

00:14:26.270 --> 00:14:28.640
What?! They asked you girls too?!

00:14:29.140 --> 00:14:31.900
Yeah! What a scary bunch of people!

00:14:31.900 --> 00:14:33.940
They were talking about Madoka, right?

00:14:33.940 --> 00:14:36.540
S...So, did you say anything?!

00:14:36.540 --> 00:14:40.080
I'm such a kind person that I told them EVERYTHING!

00:14:40.660 --> 00:14:42.300
How could you...

00:14:42.300 --> 00:14:45.470
NOT! How could I possibly do such a thing?!

00:14:45.470 --> 00:14:48.040
Still, they were rather persistent, y'know.

00:14:48.040 --> 00:14:49.000
What?!

00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:52.660
Madoka is all by herself at night, isn't she?

00:15:23.400 --> 00:15:25.850
What's with you, dressed like that?

00:15:25.850 --> 00:15:31.000
Huh? Oh! I was thinking of
starting Kendo or something.

00:15:33.110 --> 00:15:35.250
That's my Darling!

00:15:35.250 --> 00:15:37.870
In everything you do, you always
look like you know what you're doing!

00:15:37.870 --> 00:15:39.000
Well...

00:15:39.000 --> 00:15:43.380
Here's your dinner: Udon-noodles! Enjoy it while they're hot, okay?

00:15:43.920 --> 00:15:48.070
That's right, Ayukawa!
You've gotta eat up to recover quickly!

00:15:48.070 --> 00:15:49.960
Did something happen, Kasuga?

00:15:49.960 --> 00:15:50.960
Huh?
Did something happen, Kasuga?

00:15:50.960 --> 00:15:51.530
You're acting kind of odd.
Huh?

00:15:51.530 --> 00:15:52.490
You're acting kind of odd.

00:15:52.490 --> 00:15:55.550
Huh? Oh, no! Nothing's wrong! Nada!
You're acting kind of odd.

00:15:56.030 --> 00:16:01.080
Don't worry about a thing, Ayukawa,
just concentrate on getting well! Okay?

00:16:01.080 --> 00:16:03.000
That's right, Madoka.

00:16:03.440 --> 00:16:05.930
Well then, if I may...

00:16:05.930 --> 00:16:09.970
All right, tomorrow's Saturday... I'd better do my best!

00:16:16.320 --> 00:16:19.480
Welcome!

00:16:19.990 --> 00:16:23.540
Wow! Seems the atmosphere's totally changed, eh?

00:16:23.540 --> 00:16:26.650
It's like it's really brightened up in here.

00:16:26.650 --> 00:16:29.380
I make it with my 100%
pure concentrated gusto!

00:16:29.380 --> 00:16:31.610
Hikaru, why don't you work here part-time from now on?!

00:16:31.610 --> 00:16:34.660
Yeah! It'll be really merry in here,
no doubt about it!

00:16:34.660 --> 00:16:38.430
Oh, no! I'm nothing compared to Madoka!

00:16:39.940 --> 00:16:43.260
There's nothing wrong with Hikaru doing her bit...

00:16:43.260 --> 00:16:47.610
...but somehow,
Madoka seemed somewhat sad...

00:16:48.720 --> 00:16:51.440
Looks like you got much better, eh?

00:16:51.440 --> 00:16:55.460
Uh-huh. Though, if I never got better...
things might be...

00:16:59.190 --> 00:17:00.230
So, you know what I'm sayin'?

00:17:00.230 --> 00:17:02.460
Oh, gosh!
So, you know what I'm sayin'?

00:17:02.460 --> 00:17:02.550
So, you know what I'm sayin'?

00:17:02.550 --> 00:17:04.710
...might be better off.

00:17:04.710 --> 00:17:06.480
Yeah, right.

00:17:06.480 --> 00:17:09.850
That's not true, Ayukawa!

00:17:09.850 --> 00:17:16.390
Ta-da! Please enjoy it, Madoka! It's my own special pudding!

00:17:16.390 --> 00:17:17.710
It's GOOD!

00:17:17.710 --> 00:17:18.970
No thanks!
It's GOOD!

00:17:31.790 --> 00:17:34.280
S...Sorry!

00:18:03.630 --> 00:18:04.890
Ayukawa!

00:18:04.890 --> 00:18:07.120
Huh?! Kasuga!
Ayukawa!

00:18:07.120 --> 00:18:07.210
Ayukawa!

00:18:07.210 --> 00:18:10.340
What happened?
You vanished all of a sudden.

00:18:10.340 --> 00:18:12.250
I was worried about you!

00:18:12.250 --> 00:18:14.620
Oh... I was thinking of going to the hospital.

00:18:14.620 --> 00:18:19.040
The hospital?! It was only open 'til noon.
Today's Saturday.

00:18:20.780 --> 00:18:24.920
Even with her wounds,
the fact that she was so stubborn...

00:18:24.920 --> 00:18:27.800
...seemed so cute, like a little kid.

00:18:27.800 --> 00:18:31.150
You know, you shouldn't have left ABCB.

00:18:31.650 --> 00:18:32.850
Not to worry!

00:18:32.850 --> 00:18:35.560
I bet Hikaru needs you...
Not to worry!

00:18:35.560 --> 00:18:36.120
Don't you worry, I'm telling you!
I bet Hikaru needs you...

00:18:36.120 --> 00:18:37.590
Don't you worry, I'm telling you!

00:18:38.230 --> 00:18:40.250
If you're left alone, then...

00:18:43.200 --> 00:18:45.010
Oh, never mind! Never mind.

00:18:45.010 --> 00:18:46.470
Besides, everyone's...

00:18:47.500 --> 00:18:52.410
...thinking of you...
hoping that you'll get better soon.

00:18:56.710 --> 00:18:57.410
Um...

00:18:57.410 --> 00:18:57.880
What is it?
Um...

00:18:57.880 --> 00:18:57.970
Um...

00:18:57.970 --> 00:19:02.130
Er... what a beautiful sunset, isn't it?

00:19:02.130 --> 00:19:04.010
Yeah.

00:19:05.290 --> 00:19:07.620
W... What beautiful delinquent ladies!

00:19:07.620 --> 00:19:08.990
Y... Yeah.
W... What beautiful delinquent ladies!

00:19:11.590 --> 00:19:16.460
You're Ayukawa Madoka, the one who's part-timing when only in junior high...

00:19:16.870 --> 00:19:17.850
"Ayukawa?!"

00:19:17.850 --> 00:19:19.850
So what if I am?

00:19:19.850 --> 00:19:21.230
Hikaru!

00:19:21.230 --> 00:19:22.840
Shut up and stay back!

00:19:22.840 --> 00:19:25.810
We've come to pay you back!
Shut up and stay back!

00:19:31.780 --> 00:19:34.040
Goddammit! Think you're so tough?!

00:19:35.750 --> 00:19:36.850
Yo, get 'em good!

00:19:36.850 --> 00:19:38.480
Yeah!
Yo, get 'em good!

00:19:39.750 --> 00:19:43.110
Y... You'll have to go through me!

00:19:43.110 --> 00:19:44.520
Yuusaku!

00:19:45.330 --> 00:19:47.560
Really? What can I say to that!

00:19:47.560 --> 00:19:49.100
Oh, gosh!
Really? What can I say to that!

00:19:49.100 --> 00:19:49.160
Oh, boy!
Oh, gosh!

00:19:49.160 --> 00:19:50.880
Oh, boy!

00:19:50.880 --> 00:19:51.900
Komatsu!

00:19:51.900 --> 00:19:53.110
Hatta!

00:19:53.110 --> 00:19:54.450
What happened to your faces?!

00:19:54.450 --> 00:19:57.830
H... Hikaru and Yuusaku got...

00:19:58.410 --> 00:19:59.720
What?!

00:19:59.720 --> 00:20:01.780
Kasuga!

00:20:06.150 --> 00:20:08.980
Ha! What a waste of time!

00:20:14.420 --> 00:20:16.390
Hikaru!

00:20:17.530 --> 00:20:19.250
Hikaru!

00:20:20.130 --> 00:20:22.150
"Hikaru?!"

00:20:23.330 --> 00:20:25.290
Madoka...

00:20:25.290 --> 00:20:27.700
Hikaru!

00:20:28.400 --> 00:20:30.390
Hang on, Hikaru!

00:20:30.390 --> 00:20:34.550
This is... nothing, really, Madoka.

00:20:34.550 --> 00:20:38.670
Hikaru dealt with them... in place of you, Madoka.

00:20:39.680 --> 00:20:41.650
Hikaru...

00:20:42.220 --> 00:20:45.100
I'm sorry... that you got hurt like this, for my sake...

00:20:45.100 --> 00:20:51.310
Madoka... will you try
the pudding I made for you?

00:20:51.310 --> 00:20:53.110
Hikaru!

00:20:53.110 --> 00:20:56.630
Th... That hurts, Madoka!

00:21:02.400 --> 00:21:03.820
Step outside!

00:21:03.820 --> 00:21:04.960
Ayukawa!

00:21:05.310 --> 00:21:08.280
Shit... She's Ayukawa?!

00:21:38.340 --> 00:21:40.310
Show's over!

00:22:01.330 --> 00:22:03.260
Hold it.

00:22:04.130 --> 00:22:07.100
Y... Yoko!

00:22:08.240 --> 00:22:11.210
That's the kind lady who saved Linda!

00:22:17.250 --> 00:22:22.270
I understand that you saved our Linda from being run over by a truck.

00:22:23.180 --> 00:22:26.150
Oh! The dog from the other day!

00:22:29.320 --> 00:22:33.970
Miss, it seems I've caused you trouble by leaving Linda with my kid brother.

00:22:33.970 --> 00:22:37.730
From what he tells me,
he hasn't even said "thank you."

00:22:39.200 --> 00:22:42.860
When you said "payback,"
you meant THAT kind of "payback?!"

00:22:52.880 --> 00:22:55.210
You've got to listen more carefully!

00:22:56.280 --> 00:22:59.100
Wow! A non-fiction documentary!

00:22:59.100 --> 00:23:02.110
Such powerful dynamism!
It was worth getting beaten up for!

00:23:02.110 --> 00:23:06.310
Still, why didn't you tell us
how you really got injured?

00:23:06.310 --> 00:23:09.960
'Cause... I couldn't admit that I got hurt rescuing a dog; it's embarrassing!

00:23:11.900 --> 00:23:14.870
That's so like you, Madoka!

00:23:36.220 --> 00:23:40.530
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It began in the summer..."

00:23:40.530 --> 00:23:44.780
Hold me, Hold me, Hold me, Fire Love.
"It burnt up in the fall..."

00:23:44.780 --> 00:23:49.110
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It's withering in the winter..."

00:23:49.110 --> 00:23:53.350
Flare, Flare, Flare like the Sun, Fire Love...

00:23:53.350 --> 00:24:01.230
On that last night we went out for a drive,
I left my go-out voice behind.

00:24:01.230 --> 00:24:10.730
As we watched the horizon, I said good-bye.

00:24:10.730 --> 00:24:18.540
Like seasons, hit songs come and go...
As you get used to one, you're tired of it...

00:24:18.540 --> 00:24:27.220
That's what's written on your profile.

00:24:27.220 --> 00:24:36.930
You were waiting for the lucky star in your room...

00:24:36.930 --> 00:24:45.310
...I was too late to notice it in that one phone call that day.

00:24:45.310 --> 00:24:49.640
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It began in the summer..."

00:24:49.640 --> 00:24:53.980
Hold me, Hold me, Hold me, Fire Love.
"It burnt up in the fall..."

00:24:53.980 --> 00:24:58.280
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It's withering in the winter..."

00:24:58.280 --> 00:25:02.620
Flare, Flare, Flare like the Sun, Fire Love...

00:25:02.620 --> 00:25:07.440
Erase the memory of you from me...
"Stop, Stop, Stop."

00:25:13.090 --> 00:25:17.070
I saved a girl who was being
picked on by delinquent girls!

00:25:17.070 --> 00:25:19.610
She turns out to be very cute and...

00:25:19.610 --> 00:25:22.510
...well, er... I guess she's
kinda my type and...

00:25:22.510 --> 00:25:26.880
But, who would've suspected that it was Manami, who'd run away from home!

00:25:26.880 --> 00:25:30.890
Next time: "Dangerous Decision! Manami-chan's Big Adventure."
